proof_limit = "The declared Go gate checks all example suite pins, documented interfaces, complete signers and real Go receipt signature verification; it cannot execute the Python renderer or Rust key-list verifier without forbidden subprocesses or native artifacts. Native behavioral tests are supplied but are not qualified by this Go-only gate."
